    {
      "text": "The Security Policy Audit Report allows you to view your Security Policy settings and improve them by following best practices guidelines."
    },
    {
      "text": "To view the Security Policy Audit Report, from the navigation menu, go to Analytics > Reports > Security Policy Audit Report.",
