      "heading": "Report Sections",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The report has three main sections:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Traffic Inspection",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "This section includes the following settings:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "SSL/TLS Inspection: This includes the percentage of encrypted traffic that is being inspected, the Revoked Server certificate, and the Untrusted SSL Server certificate.",
